        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1784400044
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Yeah it's hard for me to say what is required in your environment, because in the version of Lean I am using, <code>use k</code> automatically closes that goal.</p>",
